Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.60,0:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do any of them care?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.68,0:00:12.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I deserve to die like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.04,0:00:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't they see I'm not\Nworth risking their lives for?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.26,0:00:25.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We, the second division of the Whitebeard\NPirates, will save our commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.16,0:00:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace, no matter what the cost. Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.80,0:00:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Please don't do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.00,0:00:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.58,0:00:33.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let me die like I'm supposed to.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.90,0:00:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Ace!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.10,0:00:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't be this stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.26,0:00:45.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.58,0:00:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn around, Bobbs.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.92,0:01:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it, Ace?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.60,0:01:10.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.40,0:01:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Ready to accept whatever I deserve.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.54,0:01:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll accept any help that's offered to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:25.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But I'll also accept any punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.88,0:01:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Either one, whichever comes first.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.90,0:01:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just ready for all this to end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.82,0:02:14.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Every time the rain no longer falls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.20,0:02:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And I see the sky.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.40,0:02:19.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I think back to when I was a child.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.34,0:02:21.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Who could only cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.02,0:02:24.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Blindly chasing after him.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.58,0:02:29.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I fall far behind my only thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.40,0:02:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,One day I will be stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.48,0:02:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Grattery and gratitude\Nfading with the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.60,0:02:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Am I stronger now than I was before?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.42,0:02:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Or as weak as back then?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.08,0:02:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know for sure, but until I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.72,0:02:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My voyage will not end.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.24,0:02:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what's next.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.38,0:02:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm walking straight ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.34,0:02:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.88,0:02:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.64,0:03:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.94,0:03:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.56,0:03:06.64,Default,,0,0,0,,And we may fall.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.72,0:03:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But we'll always keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.32,0:03:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Will take what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.80,0:03:18.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The voices inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.32,0:03:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Push me to keep surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.76,0:03:23.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll go on. I'll get through.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.64,0:03:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter what I gotta do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:30.18,Default,,0,0,0,,The fiercest thoughts\Nof all can pour upon me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.26,0:03:35.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care why in the\Nworld would I turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.18,0:03:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,So let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.36,0:03:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing that can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.98,0:03:46.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Though time's not on us.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.04,0:03:49.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I will never let it pull us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,We may fall, but we'll\Nalways keep on standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.98,0:04:01.10,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way everything will\Ntake what I hold dear away from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.18,0:04:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I know the future's there for us to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.20,0:04:23.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at that punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.50,0:04:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like he's trying to steal the show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.30,0:04:26.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Like this is his war.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.74,0:04:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It should be captain. Fugitives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.72,0:04:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's time, boss.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.44,0:04:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You gotta stand up and\Nshow the world who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.04,0:04:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.34,0:04:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Moment for you to defeat Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:37.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.42,0:04:38.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I will.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.80,0:04:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta keep stalling.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.82,0:04:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This war is.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.86,0:04:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Completely bonkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.14,0:04:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing but monsters on both sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.84,0:04:51.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll just keep my head\Ndown and stay. Quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.68,0:04:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you clown nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.56,0:04:56.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell did you just say to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.20,0:04:58.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you cruising for a bruising, punk?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.48,0:05:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.86,0:05:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I recognized you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.82,0:05:11.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You worked for Roger back\Nwhen you were just a brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.10,0:05:14.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a while, but it doesn't look\Nlike things have changed too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.78,0:05:16.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe I just threatened him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.88,0:05:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gonna kill me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.24,0:05:19.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Yep, he's a dead man.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.06,0:05:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,His only chance is to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.78,0:05:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap, it's Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.66,0:05:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's speaking to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.20,0:05:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,That is like the coolest\Nthing I've ever seen.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.90,0:05:31.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just further proof that\Nyou're a genuine living lover.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.56,0:05:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't they realize I'm about to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.20,0:05:36.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Must be nice if it's not\Nyour ass on the line?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.00,0:05:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got an entire\Nbattalion of prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're not planning on\Nchallenging me, are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.98,0:05:45.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, we meet at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.50,0:05:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now prepare yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.22,0:05:53.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez, he's pushing his luck\Nright off the edge of a cliff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.46,0:05:58.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah, it doesn't bother me\Nif you're hungry for a fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.40,0:06:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you beat me, then what's next?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:04.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Might be more Navy soldiers\Nthan you can handle on your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.32,0:06:08.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah hell, if I'm being honest,\Nthey're more than I can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.06,0:06:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, I'm not one to back\Ndown from a challenge,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.86,0:06:14.60,Default,,0,0,0,,but it would make more\Nsense to form an alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.68,0:06:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Once we're done, then you can kick my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.70,0:06:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.02,0:06:23.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard actually recognizes\Nyou as his brother-in-arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.82,0:06:25.52,Default,,0,0,0,,He considers you an equal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.78,0:06:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No, he called him a brat\Nlike one minute ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.82,0:06:30.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're gonna\Ntry to take on the Navy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.94,0:06:33.47,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't really think\Nyou can win, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.22,0:06:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I've just gotta go all out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.14,0:06:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He's completely lost his\Ngrip on reality! Seriously?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.86,0:06:43.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, I've got goosebumps!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.96,0:06:44.79,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.87,0:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I can do this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.44,0:06:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe I really was destined to be\Nking, standing on top of the world!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.88,0:06:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I think you might be onto something.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.04,0:06:56.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's join forces and take down the Navy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.64,0:06:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:00.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Man, it's too much!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.74,0:07:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright, you win, Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.40,0:07:05.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll partner with you, but only\Nbecause you're begging me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.28,0:07:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.60,0:07:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So arrogant!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.10,0:07:10.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, that's Captain Bobby!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.14,0:07:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that guy is unbelievably\Neasy to manipulate.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a fool, to say the least.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.88,0:07:20.08,Default,,0,0,0,,But the prisoners he's got behind\Nhim are something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.16,0:07:22.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The last thing we need\Nnow is more enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.88,0:07:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, back to the war.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.28,0:07:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.88,0:07:34.29,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't stop us from charging the bay!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.38,0:07:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.29,0:07:38.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Now's our chance to finally join\NPops at the center of the fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.72,0:07:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Click.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.63,0:07:43.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Come in, this is Whitebeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.10,0:07:44.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Put Squared on the line, now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.92,0:07:45.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Pops!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.04,0:07:47.51,Default,,0,0,0,,You need Captain Squared?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.70,0:07:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, he, um, he was right here just\Na few moments ago, but now, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.72,0:07:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The thing is, I'm not\Nseeing him anywhere, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.72,0:07:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, go figure.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.94,0:07:59.47,Default,,0,0,0,,All that tough talk, and then he's not\Neven around when you ask for his help.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.56,0:08:00.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.47,0:08:01.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, so it goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.40,0:08:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Get me the DeKalvin Brothers, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.74,0:08:05.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Pops, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.42,0:08:06.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Pops, what's up?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.12,0:08:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to follow my lead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.96,0:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Take command of all pirate\Ndivisions around you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.76,0:08:13.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.67,0:08:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,That's straight from Pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.74,0:08:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, all right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.92,0:08:17.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I can take the right side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.02,0:08:18.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.94,0:08:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take the left side.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.56,0:08:21.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.84,0:08:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll join in on the right side, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.74,0:08:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, if that's what Pops wants.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.20,0:08:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My ship can take any direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.18,0:08:31.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever works best.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.22,0:08:33.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Swart's missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.16,0:08:34.74,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I haven't seen him lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:35.65,Default,,0,0,0,,How unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.90,0:08:37.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Sure thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.02,0:08:39.55,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll take the left flank.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.34,0:08:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, Fleet Admiral, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.08,0:08:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But the Pirates of the New World\Nhave altered their battle tactics.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.72,0:08:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, but it seems they've\Nturned to their sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.88,0:08:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They suddenly started attacking\Nthe approaching Navy ships.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.72,0:09:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Your bluff's been called.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.54,0:09:11.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Whitebeard must have\Nsensed something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.08,0:09:14.08,Default,,0,0,0,,So I tried a cheap trick\Nand he didn't fall for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.26,0:09:16.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll admit it was a bit too obvious.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.46,0:09:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, he can't prevent the\Ninevitable just because he sees it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.14,0:09:25.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Death!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.18,0:09:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Wee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.88,0:09:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yee-haw!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.96,0:09:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa, Eva, you're all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.10,0:09:36.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Eva, we've got to clear these\Njerks out to get to Ace. Jeep it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.60,0:09:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Fish mine, karate. Yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And Gum-Gum!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.10,0:09:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Five thousand brick fish. Wee!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.80,0:09:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Fasuka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:54.58,Default,,0,0,0,,On we go!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.96,0:10:02.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah, Straw Hat, you don't really\Nthink you can get past me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.34,0:10:03.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Him again?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.26,0:10:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall be your opponent this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.56,0:10:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.14,0:10:11.06,Default,,0,0,0,,My karate skills will be more\Nthan adequate to thwart you alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.92,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,That's a mighty fine speech.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.64,0:10:15.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm impressed. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.46,0:10:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's good, because once I take care\Nof you, my zombies can run wild again.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.90,0:10:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You keep moving, Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.30,0:10:24.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't waste a moment on this villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.38,0:10:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.29,0:10:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot, Jinbe.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.21,0:10:29.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, man, I liked it better\Nwhen Jinbe was on our side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.04,0:10:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's my shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.66,0:10:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, suffer damnation, Navy soldiers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.76,0:10:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,For your shadow shall fight for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.88,0:10:53.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see how smug you are\Nwhen I turn you into sushi.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.62,0:11:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to add your\Nshadow to my collection.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.74,0:11:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll spend the rest of your\Nlife toiling within my darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,How does that sound?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.26,0:11:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take that shadow now.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.40,0:11:27.48,Default,,0,0,0,,FISHMAN CORROTTALE!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Sharkskin bob for us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.00,0:11:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And shark skin fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.70,0:12:00.54,Default,,0,0,0,,In the end you gave up those coveted\Nshadows of yours rather easily.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.62,0:12:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you should train yourself more.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.78,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you gave up and let me pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.26,0:12:06.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm done with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.40,0:12:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,My only concern is ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.10,0:12:09.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't get to lecture me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.68,0:12:11.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This fun's not over?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.20,0:12:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.12,0:12:30.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Move to Shiki!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeez!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.14,0:12:39.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:41.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Smokey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.18,0:12:42.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally found you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,About time. Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.90,0:12:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I forgot this weapon is tipped\Nwith sea prism stone, that cheater.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.70,0:12:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Fine. Second gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.54,0:12:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to let\Nyou get away this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.90,0:12:57.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Come, come.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.04,0:12:58.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Check.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.06,0:12:59.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Got me!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.12,0:13:03.40,Default,,0,0,0,,White launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:08.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a lot stronger than you used to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.50,0:13:09.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.58,0:13:12.41,Default,,0,0,0,,He's vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.49,0:13:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.60,0:13:14.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.12,0:13:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Seems I can return the compliment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.38,0:13:32.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're a real force to be reckoned with.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.18,0:13:44.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Hate to tell you, though, you're\Nstill not strong enough to beat me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.00,0:13:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You cheap jerk! Move that thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.40,0:13:50.46,Default,,0,0,0,,After all this time, I\Nfinally understand the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.70,0:13:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I know why Dragon really helped you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.18,0:13:56.89,Default,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for him\Nthat day, you'd be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.98,0:14:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You may have had Dragon to save you in\NLoguetown, but no one's gonna save you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.04,0:14:05.08,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.36,0:14:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Get your filthy hands off him!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.50,0:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,My body's smoke. How'd she hit me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.24,0:14:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't just kick him,\Nhe ate a loggia fruit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.72,0:14:20.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait a sec, why did the pirate\Nempress just save Straw Hat?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.90,0:14:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey Hancock, what the\Nhell's wrong with you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.88,0:14:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're resigning\Nfrom the warlords Shut your mouth!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.06,0:14:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,The screaming fury in my heart has\Nrendered me deaf to your words How
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.14,0:14:34.80,Default,,0,0,0,,dare you pin my beloved down with\Nyour boorish club and threaten him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.88,0:14:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You will die for your actions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.02,0:14:41.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never felt this\Nangry in my entire life.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.14,0:14:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll feed you piece by\Npiece to wild animals.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.92,0:14:48.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The Kucha's Haki is overwhelming.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.00,0:14:52.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.74,0:14:54.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.36,0:14:57.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Also, I'm happy you got\Nmy name right again.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.92,0:15:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Please, listen. That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.10,0:15:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma look it's me have\Nyou forgotten my face if
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.78,0:15:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you don't stop friendship\Nbe damned i will fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.74,0:15:14.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Back i don't know what\Nkind of a history you
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.72,0:15:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,two have but it doesn't\Nmatter trust me Empire!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.28,0:15:20.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Ivankov there's really\Nno use in talking to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.84,0:15:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,him as he is now\Ndoflamingo what do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.42,0:15:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with\Nhim you're clearly a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.12,0:15:29.80,Default,,0,0,0,,friend of bartholomew\Nkuma's so i doubt you'll
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.88,0:15:33.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this well, the man\Nyou knew as the tyrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.24,0:15:35.84,Default,,0,0,0,,kuma is not the man you see before you now
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.00,0:15:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,because that man is dead\Nbut that can't be true!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.14,0:15:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,How can kuma be dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.72,0:15:59.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.92,0:16:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Hancock was\Nsupposed to be on our side?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.42,0:16:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.18,0:16:14.59,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the key to your brother's handcuffs.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:20.88,0:16:22.56,Default,,0,0,0,,The touch of his hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.64,0:16:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,They're strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.34,0:16:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Yet so kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.78,0:16:27.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Hancock.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.46,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.06,0:16:30.89,Default,,0,0,0,,You're so awesome.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.97,0:16:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I can hug you forever!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.02,0:16:33.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll never forget this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.34,0:16:34.17,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pal!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.86,0:16:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, um, well?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.96,0:16:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's really no trouble at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.56,0:16:45.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just glad I could help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.24,0:16:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind me, though, Lupi.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.66,0:16:47.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go and save Ace.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.02,0:16:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.06,0:16:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks again!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.94,0:16:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,He managed to defeat the\Npirate empress! Unreal!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.28,0:17:04.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The stare did nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.42,0:17:05.48,Default,,0,0,0,,He's a beast!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.78,0:17:07.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.82,0:17:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,what people call...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.36,0:17:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,what they call marriage.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.68,0:17:32.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.59,0:17:33.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay back, you fool!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.51,0:17:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You shall not pass on my watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.48,0:17:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Geez, the Empress is\Nreally looking down on him!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.66,0:17:40.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Looking down so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.20,0:17:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,She started looking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way, pirate.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.88,0:17:46.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You know what happens to\Npeople who betray the Navy?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.32,0:17:47.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, do you, woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.58,0:17:51.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do whatever I like,\Nand you will allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.92,0:17:54.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.70,0:17:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the exact thing I need.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.22,0:18:00.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.34,0:18:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma is dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.72,0:18:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Then who's that big guy\Nstanding behind you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.82,0:18:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop spouting nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.20,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't deceive me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.52,0:18:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Eva.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.06,0:18:13.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And that big guy from before!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.14,0:18:25.67,Default,,0,0,0,,So, uh, were you guys\Nfriends or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.88,0:18:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We were, but he's not acting like himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.48,0:18:35.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure this is a lovely\Ntrip down memory lane for you,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.26,0:18:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm afraid the Kuma you\Nknow is no longer with us.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.70,0:18:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the new model. New\Nmodel. What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.50,0:18:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,he's talking about he\Nwants to get under my skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.04,0:18:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah okay he's acting\Npretty different than usual
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.34,0:18:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,right now but he's still\Nkuma wake up buddy hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.84,0:18:57.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you deaf or just stupid?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.24,0:19:00.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me it's no use\Ntrying to talk to him!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.12,0:19:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It happened just a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.48,0:19:04.48,Default,,0,0,0,,ago. Dr.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.66,0:19:09.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Vegapunk, the government scientist,\Nfinally finished his modifications on Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.82,0:19:14.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's the ruthless weapon of death\Nhe should have been from the start.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.42,0:19:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, the\Nformer Bartholomew Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.78,0:19:20.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Doc Vegapunk? Mods?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.04,0:19:23.10,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.18,0:19:25.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma here volunteered\Nto be a guinea pig in
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.02,0:19:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,a study to build the\Nultimate human weapon,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.76,0:19:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,run by the government, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.52,0:19:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,First, they modified his\Nhands, then his legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.90,0:19:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Although his mind was still intact,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.88,0:19:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,they modified his body\Npiece by piece until he
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.64,0:19:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,was no longer the same\NKuma you know and love.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But that's nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.66,0:19:49.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma always hated the\Ngovernment, you jerk!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:52.64,Default,,0,0,0,,As if he'd ever sacrifice\Nhimself for their stupid plan!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.72,0:19:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.82,0:19:54.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Snap out of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.88,0:19:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.62,0:19:57.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop yelling.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.70,0:19:59.56,Default,,0,0,0,,It's starting to get on my nerves.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.64,0:20:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what kind of deal\Nhe had with the government.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.88,0:20:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,He was just fine a few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.18,0:20:08.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's funny, but tragic.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.42,0:20:10.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you know it, someone's gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.28,0:20:13.44,Default,,0,0,0,,In Kuma's case,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:18.41,Default,,0,0,0,,he doesn't even realize he was ever human,\Nso the poor sap might as well be dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.52,0:20:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Now he's just a monster who the\Ngovernment has do their dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the latest, the greatest, PASSA\NFISTA, Pucci, your new old friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.30,0:20:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma, what's the big idea?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.36,0:20:49.71,Default,,0,0,0,,You better stop shooting that\Nlaser crap at me right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.08,0:20:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.94,0:20:55.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We will never meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.58,0:20:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.20,0:21:01.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Even then, he knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong, Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.94,0:21:04.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Surely you recognize me?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.46,0:21:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That was spooky. Now where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, watch out, you guys! Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.48,0:21:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Pad cannon.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.48,0:21:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn it, Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.52,0:21:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.90,0:21:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You forgot me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.04,0:21:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But how about my face spectrum?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.56,0:21:47.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This ring a bell?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.12,0:21:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,How about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.20,0:21:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Galaxy wing!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.08,0:22:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, how dare you attack my sweet,\Nsucculent crew of candy boys? You can!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.74,0:22:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't take unfashionable gestures\Nlightly, you conniving minks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.04,0:22:24.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Vengeful care!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.68,0:22:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I have met a lot of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.20,0:22:42.46,Default,,0,0,0,,but no one forgets my face!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.92,0:22:45.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No one has ever forgotten\Nmy face in my entire life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.90,0:22:47.61,Default,,0,0,0,,This manga is damn favorable!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.28,0:22:52.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Kuma!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:55.58,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to forget who you\Nare, that's your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.66,0:22:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,But if you can't remember how\Ndangerous the great Ivankov is,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.86,0:23:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,then I will beat it into you!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.10,0:23:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,So get ready, hon!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.80,0:23:08.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He is pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.46,0:23:10.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll take it from here.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.40,0:23:15.16,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, my battling beauties, keep\Ngoing and back Straw Boy up, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.24,0:23:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.68,0:23:19.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, Straw Boy, let's get him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.38,0:23:21.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks, good luck!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.32,0:23:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, ladies, get to the scaffold!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.02,0:23:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.93,0:23:32.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Starhat's gonna steal all my thunder!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.00,0:23:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Now commence Operation Ming, Captain\NBuggy, the king of the pirates!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.30,0:23:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything that's possible\Nwith me at the helm!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.62,0:23:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world will be taking it\Nback with my onslaught of awesomeness!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.50,0:23:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,All of you, follow my lead\Nand don't mess anything up!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.02,0:23:48.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Forward, you fools! Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.68,0:23:54.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I question the efficacy\Nof your latest strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.18,0:24:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,They're too many.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.78,0:24:10.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't reach him like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.40,0:24:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you even dream of touching our pops?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.88,0:24:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out of my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.70,0:24:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What a pain in the ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.70,0:24:26.11,Default,,0,0,0,,He's going to mess up our rescue mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.66,0:24:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I call this brilliant punk!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.24,0:24:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's fast. Too fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.90,0:24:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,And strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.40,0:24:47.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Quite a combination for someone that size.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.22,0:25:03.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Congrats on your escape\Nfrom prison, Katorea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.06,0:25:08.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So, did you enjoy the pool\Nof blood during your stay?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.92,0:25:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Doflamingo, keep out\Nof my business or else.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.20,0:25:15.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:15.94,0:25:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Just making small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:17.92,0:25:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,So, listen, I think we\Nmight make a good team.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.30,0:25:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.20,0:25:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you missed!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:27.80,0:25:29.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Half clear, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.60,0:25:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Nice one!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:44.68,0:25:46.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Apologies, Shanks.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.72,0:25:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,But I will not hold back against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.96,0:25:55.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I know him!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.10,0:26:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what is written.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:09.68,0:26:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Will my hand wipe his name from history?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.08,0:26:20.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Or perhaps his fortune shall spare him\Nthe fury of this black sword I wield.
